<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 24.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   93/95    100/102    UNQ    175/180</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  97/99    103/105  173/175  183/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market firmed slightly on Tuesday amid fresh buying demand on the cargo market but suppliers said they could not raise offers significantly as demand remained poor. The 380-cst grade was raised marginally by about $1 per tonne.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
